Dolby control app
=================

This branch builds only LunarisDolby (`org.lunaris.dolby`, Apache-2.0
source from crDroid's android_hardware_dolby, LunarisDolby branch). It
drives the Dolby DAP effect through `android.media.audiofx.AudioEffect`
(implementation UUID `9d4921da-8225-4f29-aefa-39537a04bcaa`) and does not
talk to the Dolby HAL directly.

The device must provide the Dolby DAX vendor stack: the DAP effect
libraries and `audio_effects.xml` entries, the
`vendor.dolby.hardware.dms@2.0` service, its VINTF entry and SELinux
policy. The proprietary blobs, codecs, shims and policy that the upstream
branch carried were removed so that they cannot conflict with the
device's own.

Include it from the device makefile:

```make
$(call inherit-product, hardware/dolby/dolby.mk)
```
